Error [E0722]: a credential value reaches `print`, a logging sink
  --> tests/ui/taint_credential_leak.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     print(secret)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `print` writes to a log, terminal, or serialized output — a `#Tainted(Credential)` value there leaks the secret
 Fix: log a non-secret field, or strip the credential with a `#Sanitizer fn` first
